{"id":"2C","title":"Fear of God","part":{"n":2,"title":"Relationship to God"},"url":"/law/02-relationship-to-god/2c","entries":[{"id":"2C.1","text":"To fear God is a primary duty of man.","refs":[{"book":"Ecclesiastes","chapter":12,"verses":"13"}],"citation":"Eccl. 12:13."},{"id":"2C.2","text":"We are commanded to fear God (you shall fear the LORD your God).","refs":[{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":10,"verses":"12"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":10,"verses":"20"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":13,"verses":"4"},{"book":"Joshua","chapter":4,"verses":"24"},{"book":"Joshua","chapter":24,"verses":"14"},{"book":"1 Samuel","chapter":12,"verses":"14,24"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":22,"verses":"23"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":3,"verses":"7"},{"book":"1 Peter","chapter":2,"verses":"17"}],"citation":"Deut 10: 121 20; Deut 13:4; Josh. 4:24; Josh. 24:14; 1 Sam. 12:14, 24; Psa. 22:23; Prov. 3:7; 1 Pet 2:17."},{"id":"2C.3","text":"The fear of God must be constantly maintained.","refs":[{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":14,"verses":"22,23"},{"book":"Joshua","chapter":4,"verses":"24"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":23,"verses":"17"}],"citation":"Deut. 14:22, 23; Josh. 4:24; Prov. 23:17."},{"id":"2C.4","text":"The eye of the LORD is on those who fear Him.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":33,"verses":"18"}],"citation":"Psa. 33:18."},{"id":"2C.5","text":"The fear of God restrains sin.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":20,"verses":"20"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":4,"verses":"4"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":16,"verses":"6"}],"citation":"Exod. 20:20; Psa. 4:4; Prov. 16:6."},{"id":"2C.6","text":"Fear of God is necessary to the worship and service of God.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":5,"verses":"7"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":2,"verses":"11"},{"book":"Hebrews","chapter":12,"verses":"28"}],"citation":"Psa. 5:7; Psa. 2:11; Heb. 12:28."},{"id":"2C.7","text":"Fear not them which can kill the body, but are unable to kill the spirit; but rather fear Him who is able to destroy both spirit and body in hell. (1067 geena (gheh'- en-nah)","refs":[{"book":"Matthew","chapter":10,"verses":"28"},{"book":"Luke","chapter":12,"verses":"4-5"}],"citation":"Matt. 10:28; Luke 12:4-5."},{"id":"2C.8","text":"God will fulfill the desires of those who fear Him.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":145,"verses":"19"}],"citation":"Psa. 145:19."},{"id":"2C.9","text":"Not to fear or reverence man (for it will bring a snare upon you).","refs":[{"book":"1 Samuel","chapter":15,"verses":"24"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":29,"verses":"25"},{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":8,"verses":"12,13"},{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":51,"verses":"12"},{"book":"Matthew","chapter":10,"verses":"28"},{"book":"John","chapter":7,"verses":"13"},{"book":"John","chapter":9,"verses":"22"},{"book":"Hebrews","chapter":12,"verses":"9"}],"citation":"1 Sam. 15:24; Prov. 29:25; Isa. 8:12,13; Isa. 51:12; Matt. 10:28; John 7:13; John 9:22; Heb. 12:9."},{"id":"2C.10","text":"Those who fear God receive mercy and acceptance from God.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":103,"verses":"11-13"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":145,"verses":"19"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":147,"verses":"11"},{"book":"Luke","chapter":1,"verses":"50"},{"book":"Acts","chapter":10,"verses":"35"}],"citation":"Psa. 103:11-13; Psa. 145:19; Psa. 147:11; Luke 1:50; Acts 10:35."},{"id":"2C.11","text":"We should have a fear of God's punishment, wrath and judgment.","refs":[{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":2,"verses":"19"},{"book":"Luke","chapter":21,"verses":"26"},{"book":"Revelation","chapter":6,"verses":"16-17"},{"book":"Hebrews","chapter":10,"verses":"27"}],"citation":"Isa. 2:19; Luke 21:26; Rev. 6:16-17; Heb. 10:27."},{"id":"2C.12","text":"The fear of the LORD is the beginning of wisdom.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":1,"verses":"7"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":9,"verses":"10"}],"citation":"Prov. 1:7; Prov. 9:10."},{"id":"2C.13","text":"Awe and reverence of God is given by fear of God.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":89,"verses":"7"}],"citation":"Psa. 89:7."},{"id":"2C.14","text":"The fear of the LORD leads to life and salvation, and he who has it will not be visited with evil.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":85,"verses":"9"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":19,"verses":"23"}],"citation":"Psa. 85:9; Prov.19:23."},{"id":"2C.15","text":"Blessings shall come to the man who fears the LORD.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":112,"verses":"1"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":128,"verses":"1,4"},{"book":"Malachi","chapter":4,"verses":"2"}],"citation":"Psa. 112:1; Psa. 128:1, 4; Mal. 4:2."}]}